t=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfurlsOGOIPE2X16JIi-ULtWICZPTkticYlTuOa2eJJAdw&oe=699DB237"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GmR5WvRZhiYQ7kNvwHrunGI&_nc_oc=AdnbaGSjXrrsylKMz5r3KHTfpnulrWVUQYpW0JD6Pvn0Z9n90QBcV9aNXrp9z02mcDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu1VzG6d6NQ4sr-HplsyijRS6ehB13t0MTjbP25m-_lSw&oe=699DB3CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ucwpv9gFtOMQ7kNvwEQ8m1d&_nc_oc=AdmXZokzBmd_wkiRj_vivEabtWv9taOXw1FH9ChB1mZbYx4JRMiFvCjReiUor59qNQM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsi36TkvqQ8ZE94sah43qkdTKbIrpewFTsqbs_cZY-Zuw&oe=699DA0EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running